{"id":"n14919-2-6","stage":3,"title":"되살리다 · 重现","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14919-2-6-1","ko":"요즘 남편이랑 자주 싸워서 짜증나.","zh":"最近我经常和老公吵架，真让人烦心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"남편이랑","meaning":"丈夫，老公","explanation":"남편：丈夫，老公；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"남편","audio":"/audio/a4e8e584126026d6f8a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31919","senseId":"1","lemma":"남편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남편이랑","audio":"/audio/7f73448e084e52d6048c.mp3"}},{"text":"자주","meaning":"常常，经常","explanation":"자주：常常，经常。","readings":[{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71199","senseId":"1","lemma":"자주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자주","audio":"/audio/604b383d216f9452c5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"싸워서","meaning":"吵架、争执","explanation":"싸우다：吵架、争执；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸워서","audio":"/audio/9e2a9a8ddbdd6eb96c1f.mp3"}},{"text":"짜증나.","meaning":"心烦，厌烦，闹心；产生、感到（짜증나다：感到烦躁）","explanation":"짜증：心烦，厌烦，闹心；나다：产生、感到（짜증나다：感到烦躁）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"짜증","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3"},{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71579","senseId":"1","lemma":"짜증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"12","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짜증나","audio":"/audio/dc24584f6